     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>The Altera Cyclone 10 GX FPGA uses a column I/O structure with 12.5 Gbps transceivers located on the left-hand side of the die. The GPIOs are arranged in vertical columns with 48 I/Os per bank, each with its own high-efficiency memory controller and I/O phase-locked loop (PLL). Additionally, each GPIO bank supports LVDS pairs with a differential input and output buffers for the Altera Cyclone 10 GX FPGA, which can be configured for each pair at speeds of up to 1.4 Gbps.</p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     },
